msgid "Türchenzeit brings 24 little moments of Advent to your WordPress website. Combine dedicated daily content with existing posts or pages, choose a design, and let a new door open each day. You can also create a fully editable Advent landing page, ready to return with fresh content each year. The German name evokes the season of opening little Advent calendar doors. Part of the Inspiration series, Türchenzeit draws on the Christmas warmth of Germany’s Ore Mountains."
msgstr ""

msgid "Türchenzeit is a German name that evokes the season of opening little Advent calendar doors: one new door each day, from December 1 to 24."
msgstr ""

msgid "Türchenzeit is a personal project by David Decker, who comes from the Erzgebirge, or Ore Mountains, in southeastern Germany. The region has a rich tradition of Christmas woodcraft: carved figures, wooden Christmas pyramids, and Schwibbögen, the candle arches that light up windows during the festive season. That sense of light, craftsmanship, and welcome is the inspiration behind the plugin’s atmosphere."
msgstr ""

